ShopOwnProfileResponse.description:
The signed-in shop's own profile, for its settings screen (s-settings). IReadOnlyList&lt;ShopProfileField&gt; ShopOwnProfileResponse.EditableFields is the admin
policy: the server rejects a change to any other field (R-SHP-03). Shop-facing contract: no customer contact data;
string? ShopOwnProfileResponse.PublicPhone is the shop's own business number.
